                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <P align=center><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201909/2019092915361464.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">为认真贯彻《中共中央国务院关于深化教育教学改革全面提高义务教育质量的意见》，全面落实省、市、区读书会精神，进一步深化中小学教育评价改革，加强初中学业评价能力建设，培养和锻炼一批集中考命题、品质教学、精准辅导于一体课程改革骨干教师队伍，进一步推动初中学校发展方式的转变，支撑越城教育的首位度，绍兴市越城区教师发展中心组织开展了“越城区初中教育提升发展”高级研修活动。此次研修活动在一中举行。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3 face=Calibri> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201909/2019092915364603.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P><FONT color=#000000><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US>9</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">月</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>24</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">日上午</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>8</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">点</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>30</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">分，研修活动开班仪式在校树兰楼三楼会议室一正式举行。绍兴市第一中学校长王琛、绍兴市越城区教体局教育科科长骆建江出席会议。区属各初中正校长或分管校长、课程教学处主任，区属各初中初三年级语文、数学、英语、科学、社会&#8226;法治五门学科骨干教师共</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>96</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">人参加。仪式由越城区教科室主任、越城区教师发展中心主任何灿华主持。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal></FONT></SPAN></FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3 face=Calibri> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201909/2019092916031505.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">仪式伊始，<B>王琛</B>代表绍兴一中对各位初中校长、主任、老师的到来表示热烈欢迎，并对一直以来关心和支持一中发展的越城区教体局、各初中学校表示衷心的感谢！他从初高中学校教育发展的角度出发，就初高中学校间的互助互动提出了三点想法：<B>一是着眼学生成长，多交流互动；二是着重共同成长，多学术探讨；三是着力一中发展，多帮助宣传。</B>最后他预祝本次研修活动取得圆满成功！</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3 face=Calibri> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201909/2019092916032654.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">锡麟中学副校长<B>祁钢</B>作为参会学员代表发言。他代表所有学员表态：<B>一定静心学习，做到学有所思，学有所悟，学有所获！</B>他还从自己从事教育教学一线工作的经历出发，谈到自己对全面提升初中教育质量的三点感悟：首先，必须遵循党的教育方针，结合实际，研究出台新的符合新时代需要的学校各项发展制度；其次，要站在教师的角度和立场思考，扎扎实实做实事，制定具有可操作性、可持续发展的教学评价及考评体系；最后，还需要支持鼓励教师大胆实践，宽容失败，及时总结经验，给教师们创造更多的发展平台。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3 face=Calibri> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201909/2019092916033881.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">骆建江</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">在讲话中提到此次研修活动是一次领悟教育人初心、践行教育人使命的<B>创新之举</B>，也为初中教育提质提效提供了<B>提升之策</B>，更为初高中衔接教育铺出了一条<B>共赢之道</B>。同时，他对参会学员提出了十二字要求：<B>安心研修，尽心悟道，潜心实践。</B>相信每位学员都能在此次活动中有所收获！</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3 face=Calibri> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201909/2019092916034844.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">初中教师目前是义务教育的最高阶段，是基础教育的核心部分，担负着承前启后的重要作用，直接关系着每一位学子的成长、成才。<B>何灿华</B>呼吁在座各位校长、主任、教师正视初中教育中的突出问题、明确初中教育的提升目标、创新初中教育的发展方式，做到八个聚焦：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">聚焦发展规划、聚焦学段衔接、聚焦评价导向、聚焦主题文化聚焦课堂改革、聚焦技术引领、聚焦名师支撑、聚焦优质均衡。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3 face=Calibri> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201909/2019092916040474.png" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201909/2019092916040466.png" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">据悉，本次高级研修活动为期三天，</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>9</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">月</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>24</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">日</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>-9</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">月</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>26</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">日。活动以<B>报告讲座、教学观摩、教学研讨、实地考察</B>等多种形式展开，培训内容主要围绕中小学教育质量综合评价监测情况分析，初中学业考试命题及教学改进等。<B>专家报告与讲座</B>，使学员们更明晰初中教育提升发展的意义、路径与策略，了解考试评价改革与命题技术，并对基础教育提升发展政策有更为深入的了解。学员们还将进入高一课堂进行<B>现场教学观摩</B>，与高中教师共话初高中衔接教学，并且<B>实地踏看</B>一中校史陈列室、鲁迅工作室、蔡元培纪念馆等人文景观，在对话与行走中感受校园文化考察学校文化、分享教育智慧。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
